---
layout: base.njk
title: null
---
<div class="layout">
  <div class="desk">
    <div class="intro">
      <div class="intro-copy">
        <h1><a href="/">Marjorie Has Ideas</a></h1>
        <div class="tagline-group">
          <p class="tagline-line">Some are useful. Some are ridiculous.</p>
          <p class="tagline-line">A surprising number become websites.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <img class="portrait" src="/img/logos/msw%20pencil%20drawing%203.jpg" alt="Pencil drawing of Marjorie">
    </div>
    <p class="bio">I work in pharma R&amp;D IT by day. On the side, I build small, oddly specific things — an NFL betting model that isn't very accurate but I'm still up $50, a weather email service that skips the ads, a run tracker that shows exactly what I need to see to stay motivated. Come see what I made while I was supposed to be doing something else.</p>

    <div class="field">
      {% for stamp in stamps %}
        {% include "stamp.njk" %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="log-panel">
    <div class="log-head">what I'm working on now</div>
    {% for post in collections.posts %}
      <a class="entry" href="{{ post.url }}">
        <span class="date">{{ post.date | postDate }}</span>
        <span class="title">{{ post.data.title }}</span>
        <span class="teaser">{{ post.data.teaser }}</span>
      </a>
    {% endfor %}
    <img class="log-mark" src="/img/logos/MHI%20color%20scheme%202.png" alt="Marjorie Has Ideas">
  </div>
</div>
